    "detailed_description": "A malevolent force known only as Lina is devouring data from a vast, interdimensional network of servers overseen by sentient computers called \u201dmotes.\u201d In desperation, the motes summon heroes from a variety of parallel game worlds to face off against each other in one-on-one combat. The tournament victor has the potential to be awakened as the Blade Stranger\u2014the savior who can vanquish Lina and protect the motes from further harm!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped by Studio Saizensen, Blade Strangers is a hardcore old-school fighting game. The streamlined four-button control scheme makes it easy for beginners to deal out damage from day one\u2026but the intricate combos, counters and specials give tournament-caliber players plenty of opportunities for frame counting, chain construction and hit-box science.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Fighter roster includes characters from previous Studio Saizensen games (like Code of Princess and Sayonara Umihara Kawase), Nicalis games (like Cave Story+) and other surprise entrants<br />\r\n-Each character has eight different color settings and their own familiar \u201chome\u201d stage<br />\r\n-Proprietary development system transforms 3-D models and animation into 2-D spritework; every frame looks like a gorgeous anime drawing<br />\r\n-Online competition play<br />\r\n-Accessible controls designed to bring fresh blood to the ranks of fighting-game fans worldwide",
